                    <p>
                        The third article in the Mesopotamian Influence edition of BET KANU Magazine takes you on a fascinating journey to discover the origins of the alphabet from its earliest beginnings, its evolution from Akkadian cuneiform to the first Canaanite alphabet, and its subsequent development in Phoenicia and Aramaic, and its influence on other alphabets.
                   </p>
